Re"></p></td><td rowspan="2"><p id="doxmyV7yshDyHzgAev6qTFPGh8G" align="center">Yes or No</p><p id="doxmyucNCiZ9gRwYFpezeS0X23R"></p></td><td rowspan="2"><p id="doxmyi7rLsL1rlgQyJvj0POlQSg" align="center">2021/1/5</p><p id="doxmyLmdswbcpCDBsoReRGlKeCf"></p></td></tr><tr><td><p id="doxmyk3jaCoX3Z5pvNmLUUKDs3b">Key Region (if applicable)</p><p id="doxmyBaNbt2LQ4B4JRTXAC4SiDc">//核心区域（如果有）</p></td><td><p id="doxmyFieN8diGMVwgMSYwSWWw1d"></p></td><td><p id="doxmyDXp4sidMJB0znbelemKMAc"></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxmym8XphJtQ9fs6QFAKguObTc"></p><blockquote id="doxmyFkm0xvvK7yk3dYCxXPAmUh"><p id="doxmyUmTLJ0UnEmcWZLzqh1VBZb"><b>Clients //客户端</b></p></blockquote><sheet id="doxmyL3XtHsWVaOt9rlxeDh8eOf" sheet-id="SeMGXh" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHnyte"></sheet><p id="doxmyk1e8YSLEzwD4kuUC85YWRd">T&amp;S advise against adding new features to Kids mode be default for compliance purposes. If you want to, read this document//T&amp;S从合规角度不建议向儿童模式增加新的功能。如果需要新增，请阅读这个文档 <cite doc-id="doccnfaMkWBbuJVQDSTi7EqTpUc" file-type="doc" title="Add Kids Mode evaluation section to PRD template" type="doc"></cite> </p><blockquote id="doxmyRoAn6MIabDDBRbgkxs2fjg"><p id="doxmy2FFcaW2qGXyxXm6Eqjmgid"><b>TTP</b><b> Impact</b><b> //TTP 影响评估</b></p></blockquote><sheet id="doxmyzkMXMC8FELHJcZkHCyhIzf" sheet-id="Bn4J5d" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHnyte"></sheet><blockquote id="doxmyEOo3BaZqTz2zOu9ShfS3Dd"><p id="doxmySvPoQtADd9SJodxsUEeimd"><b>PDPO</b><b> Impact //PDPO 影响评估</b></p></blockquote><sheet id="doxmy5Dy49f1CQ4piiwu61sCMZc" sheet-id="7O2rb4" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHnyte"></sheet><p id="doxmywtK70jDXSbxNpeHvZgYwva"></p><h1 id="doxmyBvItLbS2FCLH4LKPtXrtlb">Feature Results//需求结果</h1><p id="doxmyKYiOcYj91OmCGGIGBfPane">Complete this section <u>after development</u>. This section is for sharing your feature results in two dimensions: //请<u>开发完成后</u>再填写此模块，此部分通过两个维度分享你的需求结果。 </p><ol><li id="doxmyoSKHmFTuA491cjHjia1Evg" seq="1" seq-marker="1. "><b>Visual representation</b>: Before the feature becomes available to any user, PM owner is responsible for sending a notification with screen recording to the Lark group <b>[TikTok New Feature Initial Release Notification]&amp;[TikTok-livestream launch notice]//</b></li></ol><sheet id="doxmy6JOfHwDFNT1tSon0fp9csd" sheet-id="GrxUi3" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHnyte"></sheet><ol><li id="doxmyFF6iolNYrFNPAogcGmNbcc" seq="2" seq-marker="2. "><b>Usage data</b>: PM owner is responsible for sharing experiment results of the feature to the Lark group <b>[TikTok Feature Result Sharing].And put it on to the conclusion </b><a href="https://bytedance.feishu.cn/sheets/shtcn8HcaVHX7SG0Qo5hFLXqKNe?sheet=VpuNZK&amp;table=tblQfx960h0cUHAh&amp;view=vewTFWCTPM"><b>document</b></a><b>. </b></li></ol><sheet id="doxmyDLG1dwumsEs5ovfa2dYD6d" sheet-id="X6BTEu" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHnyte"></sheet><h1 id="doxmyuI4A1JppQr1xkHCjc9XIUh">Intro &amp; Goal//需求介绍和目标</h1><blockquote id="DCaWdREETosvrFxPSFTmHqONyyh"><ul><li id="Z44vdtKZIonMW1xsLpVmna09yrr">关于Rena侧提出的另一圈人量级扩充需求：旧链路受 Ida / 风神查询引擎限制，圈人上限约 200 万，圈人平台计划替换底层查询引擎(DP 直连 ClickHouse)以将量级提升至 100 万~1 亿，该需求由的独立 PRD 承接<cite doc-id="D3nhdazV1ourDhx6WkhmDiigyEj" file-type="docx" title="[cohort]千万量级圈人引擎查数切换" type="doc"></cite>。本需求后置拆包能力与量级无关，但其可支持的上限依赖上述引擎替换的交付。</li><li id="LyeLdojzPoasRdx9Jl5mx8K8y2d">业务侧对cohort前端母包子包在UI层面展示无诉求，故本次需求为纯后台需求。</li></ul></blockquote><h3 id="doxmy5CFdMvDz1TeQYuRRDJR1Tg" comment-refs="c1">What are we building?//需求概述</h3><p id="doxmylLCghBi6HriFbAv4ciGDfe">圈人平台将新增 "人群包拆分" 能力: 支持将一个已圈定的母人群包，按业务语义规则 (如是否参与、是否完成活动任务) 拆分为多个子人群包，供运营对不同人群做差异化、精细化触达。拆包在触发时刻使用活动方提供的最新数据执行 (即 "实时拆包")，圈人平台在其中承担枢纽角色 —— 运营指定拆分规则、活动方提供数据、圈人平台完成拆分并产出子包，以支持主播触达等场景的使用。</p><h3 id="doxmyJmlcdTyZ6WjPgoOAEJ7HCf">Why build it?//需求背景</h3><p id="K7Ixdtczloxcq6xVO33m98RyyTe"><b>（1）业务背景</b></p><p id="IDIpdgAu1ouaVmxb049mRtczysf">业务上主播有大量运营活动需"圈人 → 触达"，当前运营侧的核心诉求是：对一个<b>已经圈到的人群包</b>，能够<b>按业务语义拆得更细</b>，从而对不同人群做差异化触达。例如活动进行中，向"未参与 / 未达成目标"的主播下发针对性的激励文案，而不是对全部人群发送同一套文案。</p><p id="Hjf6dTH4VoAX0Zx9PzSmnJUQyUb"><b>现状：</b>运营在自身入口上做不到这件事，因为缺少一套能结合活动数据做拆分的底层能力。</p><p id="Oq83d5QFio4IXvxEJuCmJ8EgyWg"><b>（2）系统整体链路与问题概览图</b></p><whiteboard id="PEqbdBJeloJsW1xz405mJMs1yrd" token="M6K0wiVKPhxa8pbxpzHm0HuByKc"></whiteboard><p id="CslAdMjgeo04ubxA2xfmIYtBypd"></p><h3 id="doxmyDPYo3QfEt27cMuZVrXUTMd">What are our Success Metrics?//核心关注指标</h3><ul><li id="CkF0dXxxro2Ul9xRC0wmrQo2yxb">拆包成功率与拆分准确率</li><li id="PwzWdZIZxohJ4TxD9L8m62uoyJd">差异化触达带来的业务转化提升 (如未参与人群的参与率、任务完成率)</li></ul><h3 id="doxmyTPxFoprcnT7qSTxbrbJG8g">Who has to know? // 谁需要知晓这个功能？</h3><ul><li id="Z3qedbRm8oVvAmxZTFwm638LyBh">运营：功能使用方，提供拆包所需数据口径</li><li id="WJVhd99SUolJ4HxwtOhmrmqpyYf">活动方：提供拆包所依赖的活动数据</li><li id="D0Ecdhbqkof448xW7LKm8RRMyJd">圈人平台研发：功能实现方</li><li id="GymVdCEZToYLV4xutiBm902Fyib">Rena 团队：消费方</li></ul><h3 id="doxmyCFVh2jq3Z8zuQIN3lQXq9d">What will be different? // 功能上线后会有什么变化？</h3><ul><li id="Kywxd4RUtoQ1szx7Dx6m96VGyqg">运营从 "只能统一发文案" 到 "可按业务语义拆分人群、差异化触达"<ul><li id="VG0odUN7Co48YmxXKNJmVENqyZf">before运营只能给一个活动圈到的所有主播发同一条消息</li><li id="JVshdXh0OohtvLx0vzhmy0xuyws">after现在能把这批人按不同情况分组, 给每组发不同的消息</li></ul></li></ul><p id="doxmyLJiUmnQfP1QZ6WRFnWo7Ze"></p><h1 id="doxmybwSfrl0pmxbqoWjQGtWQ1b">Requirement Detail//需求细节</h1><h3 id="doxmywD05lG0Ysjq1Wy3aJ73tjf">Color Mark // 颜色标记</h3><ul><li id="doxmyGAMqEaHuHPHumXX74RP6Se"><span background-color="rgba(186,206,253,0.7)">Wording // 文案</span></li><li id="doxmyjNiL1keSfPNd32UoUJJ1Gg"><span background-color="rgba(205,178,250,0.7)">PM</span><span background-color="rgba(205,178,250,0.7)"> attention // 需产品确认</span></li><li id="doxmySLEVxN1XzV5O1XaurUFhPb"><span background-color="rgba(222,224,227,0.8)">UED</span><span background-color="rgba(222,224,227,0.8)"> attention // 需要设计关注</span></li><li id="doxmyHbJbNyIOs1fFDA6YkWPCMd"><span background-color="rgba(254,212,164,0.8)">RD</span><span background-color="rgba(254,212,164,0.8)"> attention // 需研发确认或注意</span></li><li id="doxmyymRqUozCu1EOJ8mu0KuHjG"><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">Data warehouse attention // </span><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">数仓</span><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">关注或确认</span></li><li id="doxmybCUOWWFbhkxrPr8e5h0LFi"><span background-color="rgb(251,191,188)">TNS</span><span background-color="rgb(251,191,188)"> attention // TNS 关注或确认</span></li><li id="doxmy5kGvc8OYuB00mBUSqiYFN9"><span background-color="rgba(255,246,122,0.8)">New added // 有更新</span></li></ul><h3 id="doxmyfPKtIrLeAR1rK7sLbFfKXj">User Interaction &amp; Design//用户交互&amp;设计</h3><table id="doxmy27bvJzZpSDYPr1m2Ns0gcM"><colgroup><col width="273"/><col width="513"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td background-color="rgb(240,244,255)"><p id="doxmy1smYttuWKS2yiTSnB7z3Fb"><b>Need data chart?</b></p><p id="doxmycHoMbaFFSHcYHheHq2Br2k"><b>是否涉及数据图表？</b></p><blockquote id="doxmyYBP1cgeEHmQUqAQYisRefh"><p id="doxmyQ72nOlJpznhu9DH64cquFf"><cite doc-id="ZRngd9TApo30A4xX349lCd1kgLm" file-type="docx" title="Data Roblox 支持的前端组件化能力" type="doc"></cite></p></blockquote></td><td><checkbox id="doxmyZ4b1L3BzEnH0ujn0LMD9bZ" done="false">YES<checkbox id="doxmyH2l7Ilda73ppce61ijdYwf" done="false">Data Roblox 支持（现有组件库可满足需求）</checkbox><checkbox id="doxmym6cBi4FKlRJjS1zFEqHQFh" done="false">Data Roblox 迭代组件支持（通用场景但组件库现有能力不满足）</checkbox><checkbox id="doxmyYhcp6QfFHi36wAZ9cbiP2c" done="false">定制化（需设计单独出稿+业务FE开发）</checkbox><checkbox id="doxmyXsm7hnSIJx8db5hGMY38Ic" done="false">组内讨论争议点</checkbox></checkbox><checkbox id="doxmydQYtgqPNpw8JGt9TNwwIJd" done="true">NO</checkbox></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="ZhwGdH6toox1Wzx2nDrmIgiYyId" comment-refs="c2">方案描述（本次方案均为后端逻辑）</h3><table id="A57EdOytVoqMgaxqRojmGrqJywe"><colgroup><col width="167"/><col width="694"/><col width="363"/></colgroup><thead><tr><th background-color="rgb(240,244,255)"><p id="Ri3CdCYDcoP9tNxEED0mPotWycb">标题</p></th><th background-color="rgb(240,244,255)"><p id="F8szdlIGXosC1jxDLaWmVo5kyeh">详细描述</p></th><th background-color="rgb(240,244,255)"><p id="YfCRd4XCZoaNTbxE3yjmFYV2y7g">备注</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p id="MB7gdu7E7oSSYnxhdHGmhqkOyuc"><b>1.1 方案总述</b></p></td><td><p id="FWowdV0AwocWiLxZW28mJK3cyRh">本方案在<b>不改动母包产出、不改动触达底层</b>的前提下，通过<b>DP的 "后置拆包链路"，</b>把一个母包按活动实时状态一拆多、落成多个独立子人群包，再由触达底层分包发不同文案。实现<b>圈人只产一次母包，拆分下沉到发送前的旁路环节，并用实时状态取数拆包</b>。</p><p id="XavWdlkfwowgzXxuiSOmeU8lyOc"></p><p id="GQ2xdWnN9oUFsix79yZmo1Wfytc"><b>旧逻辑：</b></p><ul><li id="Mq4cdIsiNo0LzhxjZpLmZzNpy3g"><b>Rena</b>: 运营用自然语言配置圈人目标。</li><li id="SJwkduKh2o33xzx4fmCmdS8Nytd"><b>Ida / 风神 (查询引擎)</b>: 查询公共数据集，拿到 UID。</li><li id="TAo3dKjlqopoIWx5q5zmgelWyWe"><b>圈人平台 (DP)</b>: 把 UID 生成一个人群包 (一次性离线导出)，不具备按活动数据拆分的能力。</li><li id="ZdpFdN429oIU8IxFLVKmnvIYyIf"><b>运营 (人工)</b>: 需要分群时，靠人工把人群包拆开 (圈人平台不支持，只能人工操作)。</li><li id="MgnHd8SPeo0ajNxUxBmmA3sQyOd"><b>触达系统 (message /campaign 等)</b>: 对拆出来的人群发送内容。</li></ul><p id="UBzUdCMn2oU4E0xPMmAmzuWSyYg"></p><p id="JBrwdjgUFoU2pnxGSjcmzd3MyrA"><b>新逻辑：</b></p><ul><li id="GuKIdBXV1o2FDFxuau0mKEpDy6f"><b>Rena</b>: 运营用自然语言配置 (不变)。</li><li id="Ko6UdePOxoelvJxpn60mHnMwybb"><b>数据平台自研查询引擎 (直连 ClickHouse)</b>: 替代 Ida / 风神完成查询，拿到 UID。<span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)">--另起需求实现</span></li><li id="INO9dw1SOo9BjhxzOUomX2k4yxh"><b>圈人平台 (DP)</b>: 生成母包 (cohort_0)。</li><li id="GKeRdKyLUoW6hNxNtWbmCs6iyId"><b>数据平台 (DP) 自动化拆包</b>: 按活动最新数据实时把母包拆成子包，拆包环节做实时过滤。</li><li id="Qrm5dganxotDQgxZl39mRWisy1c"><b>触达系统 (message /campaign 等)</b>: 各子包分别发送，结果落库 (hive) 。</li></ul></td><td><p id="JZ9edahE1onYq2xsDggmagGHyih">新旧逻辑对比</p><whiteboard id="AguidAvIOoQOdsxPk3LmQm1kydb" token="CzoDwlhr4hTeE4bDth4mdqWKyXm" type="mermaid">flowchart TB
