  autonumber
  participant DP as 圈人平台/DP
  participant RC as Reach/Campaign 发起方
  participant SPLIT as 后置拆包链路(DP旁路)
  participant ENG as Campaign 实时引擎
  participant MSG as Message 触达底层
  participant U as 终端用户 uid

  Note over DP: 离线阶段 (T+1)
  DP-&gt;&gt;DP: 产出母包 cohort_0(全量圈选主播 UID 全集)
  DP-&gt;&gt;RC: 交付 cohort_0
  RC-&gt;&gt;SPLIT: 发起拆包 / 对 cohort_0 发起后置拆包任务

  Note over SPLIT: 拆包(异步, 小时级)
  SPLIT-&gt;&gt;ENG: 逐批查询活动实时数据(访问/报名/开播...)
  ENG--&gt;&gt;SPLIT: 返回每个 uid 的状态
  SPLIT-&gt;&gt;SPLIT: 按口径把 cohort_0 一拆二
  SPLIT-&gt;&gt;DP: 落 Hive:生成 cohort_A + cohort_B(2个独立子人群包id)

  Note over MSG: 下游各自整包读取
  DP-&gt;&gt;MSG: 提供 cohort_A(如:已访问未报名)
  DP-&gt;&gt;MSG: 提供 cohort_B(如:未访问)
  MSG-&gt;&gt;MSG: task_A 读取 cohort_A 全部 UID
  MSG-&gt;&gt;MSG: task_B 读取 cohort_B 全部 UID
  MSG-&gt;&gt;U: task_A 发文案A
  MSG-&gt;&gt;U: task_B 发文案B</whiteboard><p id="ANiCduGezoFiEUxwbBUm7CpyyCc"></p><p id="HCzmdK8qyobRyUxdLNrmXtjeynb"></p><p id="OlvedU6g0oN7UQx3HnimdFBPytg"></p></td></tr><tr><td><p id="CLPgdcBTZoU5k3xPm8Fmf9kLynh"><b>环节2 后置拆包 (异步，小时级，DP 旁路)</b></p><ol><li id="QqEEdOrSroxqNDxNXj7mgbrQyEe" seq="3" seq-marker="3. "><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">DP向发起方请求 cohort_0 </span><b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">后置拆包任务</span></b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">, 交由DP旁路的后置拆包链路执行 (与母包产出解耦，不阻塞主链路)。</span></li><li id="B6xSdJxIVoI3JTxLcehmZCvLyTg" seq-marker="4. "><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">拆包链路</span><b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">逐批查询 Campaign 实时引擎</span></b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">, 取 cohort_0 内每个 uid 的活动实时数据 (是否访问 / 是否报名 / 是否开播……)，拆包维度见1.3的说明。</span><span background-color="rgba(186,206,253,0.7)">Campagin需要新增接口回传信息。</span></li><li id="A0qIdROUtoTvXtxMNKimoW9nykb" seq-marker="5. "><span background-color="rgba(186,206,253,0.7)">实时引擎返回每个 uid 的状态。</span></li><li id="GgkAdK8MYonbYYx46WBmRHRfyDh" seq-marker="6. "><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">拆包链路按</span><b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">发起方定义的口径</span></b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">把 cohort_0 一拆多。</span></li><li id="KqGjdAHxTo59uXx3W2lme0u3yTf" seq-marker="7. "><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">结果落 Hive, 生成 </span><b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">cohort_A + cohort_B 两个独立子人群包 id</span></b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">, 并登记回圈人平台 / DP。</span></li></ol></td></tr><tr><td><p id="DlBWdDddko94GzxAlAymjewayjd"><b>环节3 分包触达</b></p><ol><li id="RUgVdFa3RoJMEqxj6d9ma7Ojy9b" seq="8" seq-marker="8. "><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">圈人平台 DP 把 </span><b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">cohort_A</span></b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">(如：已访问未报名) 提供给 Message 触达底层</span>。<span background-color="rgba(205,178,250,0.7)">message接口适配。</span></li><li id="Ftg4dRYxAoBCAhxkXWvmpBF7yUg" seq-marker="9. "><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">同样把 </span><b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">cohort_B</span></b><span background-color="rgba(183,237,177,0.8)">(如：未访问) 提供给触达底层。</span></li></ol><p id="O0HwdKjqQoM786xGNuMmgw3Eyse">10–11. <span background-color="rgba(205,178,250,0.7)">触达底层为每个子包起独立 task:task_A 读取 cohort_A 全部 UID,task_B 读取 cohort_B 全部 UID。</span></p><p id="X9PodyQ5aoRy2fxOnANmprXfysf">12–13.<span background-color="rgba(205,178,250,0.7)"> task_A 发文案 A、task_B 发文案 B, 分别触达对应人群，实现差异化触达。</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="5"><p id="QTnXdISvooLTgSxSrg4mnGmQytg"><b>1.3 拆包策略</b></p><p id="VVQsdVLvnoc1oYxKr9sm5wVoyPd"></p></td><td><ol><li id="BUp4ddhCPoqXehx5tK1m4bWayAb" seq="1" seq-marker="1. "><b>拆包输入与依据</b>，参考活动侧常用指标<cite doc-id="XRgcduXcyooS0txhIzccHonBnLg" file-type="docx" title="Reach Agent 活动指标list" type="doc"></cite></li></ol><p id="VsrLdRglGoDUjvxuBM3mzAJeyST">输入（母包）</p><p id="JZTid2E0Mo1QSIxUwzymIBH6yoh">母包 = 本次活动 <code>is_targeted = 1</code> 的全部圈选主播 UID 并集，由圈人平台生成 cohort_0。</p><p id="BS7wdP6JcoPl0Kx7cqcm35loyoe">拆包依据（活动方提供，实时取值）</p><img id="UA4ndWCs7o726exPNfpmTCLly4e" name="截屏2026-09-04 12.57.25.png" height="584" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="TmQ6bB7BPovAXSx6gjtmd1TTycd" width="1318"/><p id="XyRfdSmIBoDjqAxPMzMmdeXcyag"></p></td><td rowspan="5"><p id="D8erdVx81oZGhExgqmsmylOlynd">-</p><p id="BJXKdJJavofHz5xRxNtmzHb2y7d"></p></td></tr><tr><td><ol><li id="FLyhd27mNoGfm9xwDYemkbXCyDc" seq="2" seq-marker="2. "><b>拆包规则</b></li></ol><p id="TKFqdLIZQotzbTxkkSvmLmtzylf"><b>A. 报名型分支（</b><b><code>has_register_gameplay=1</code></b><b>）</b></p><img id="WoM6ds8Wcowch6xCO3UmiNGpyBh" name="截屏2026-09-08 12.08.52.png" height="504" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="KOWFbmYydo1pByxyJpRmv8swyYd" width="1356"/><p id="CkJGdE6cbo4fG0xE77xmL1RSysf"><b>B. 非报名型分支（</b><b><code>has_register_gameplay=0</code></b><b>）</b></p><img id="R9FZdQKVRopA1fxusmUmYF5Wy0b" name="截屏2026-09-08 12.09.08.png" height="512" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="Y35kbBrkPoFEEKxvh3ZmLynsyWd" width="1350"/><p id="JBzQdQBjqohJR2xgJR7mCP2ty79"></p></td></tr><tr><td><ol><li id="WkLDdYGJfokQKNxMTDim8EPUyXc" seq="3" seq-marker="3. "><b>拆包时机与去重</b></li></ol><ul><li id="MbfNdbgyuonfv9xDSOCmDoXayvh"><b>实时取值：</b>报名、开播等状态字段在拆包 / 发送触发时刻实时准出，非 T+1 快照，避免"已报名仍收到催报名"的错发。</li><li id="OyrgdcZgioTpYDxRfEGm9AnoyTh"><b>互斥拆分：</b>按 <code>has_register_gameplay</code> 分报名型 / 非报名型两条互斥支路；每条支路内按漏斗深度从深到浅排列，同一 uid 首次命中即归属该子包，命中深层不再落浅层（如报名型用户已报名 → 只进 S4，不再进 S3 / S1），保证任意 uid 有且仅有一个子包归属。</li></ul><p id="YbERdfA0QofLHexJeP6mHGaEyFo"></p></td></tr><tr><td><ol><li id="JXRvdsJzEoVvUrxAbzRmhlsBy2g" seq="4" seq-marker="4. "><b>示例（1000 万量级报名型活动，</b><b><code>has_register_gameplay=1</code></b><b>）</b></li></ol><ul><li id="Bq4OdBO1Zo91rSxAYy0mAdZoynd">母包 cohort_0 = 全部 <code>is_targeted=1</code> 主播。</li><li id="JJFmd5qz4oqBt3xSuJGmDAeGybg">近 30 天登录但未访问活动页 → 命中 <b>S1</b>，推拉访问文案。</li><li id="VriTdcNwYop1JaxW8a5mnXrlyVg">已访问但未报名（<code>page_visited=1 AND registered=0</code>）→ 命中 <b>S3</b>，推催报名文案。</li><li id="QO13dGl55o2ieWxgXKLm1biEyad">已报名（<code>registered=1</code>）→ 命中 <b>S4</b>，推引导开播文案（因深层优先，已报名用户不再进 S3 / S1）。</li></ul><p id="NHe9dwyZ1oYlRNxRONcmg0Kayeb"></p></td></tr><tr><td><ol><li id="PUqQdi0fioF750xnxaEmYDcYydh" comment-refs="c3" seq="5" seq-marker="5. "><b>拆包策略的通用化方案</b></li></ol><ul><li id="YJccdRMSqodVXpxcj95mmDCpyCd">方案：分为拆包平台层---可复用、数据接入层---老指标复用&amp;新指标接入</li></ul><whiteboard id="GvOgdZ2cWo1oU3xrODWmZhX7yJb" token="OHJEwYDkThjtpfbx1ybm8Ph2ypb" type="mermaid">flowchart TB
