看板" type="doc" view-id="vewVLrjOYz"></cite></span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)">. If not, please notify  </span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)"><cite type="user" user-id="ou_cbbf5be5b3f41692dcb668f90abb9a15" user-name="彭伟春"></cite></span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)">to add the page.     如需部署，请详述部署信息，并查看US/EU Arena 前端页面列表</span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)"><cite doc-id="RCYgb4HdMa6ejXs3tpildY2cgIb" file-type="bitable" table-id="tbltVuVdKGa8o2Pu" title="Arena多环境可视化看板" type="doc" view-id="vewVLrjOYz"></cite></span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)">中是否已包含所需页面，如未包含，请通知</span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)"><cite type="user" user-id="ou_cbbf5be5b3f41692dcb668f90abb9a15" user-name="彭伟春"></cite></span><span text-color="rgb(216,57,49)">增加页面。</span></li></ol><p id="doxmyCoG4Z3aq6FGEXjY0OAMFqc"><b>Data interoperability  数据互通</b><p id="doxmy5Ev8vy0YROufjIakiBEv8c">Confirm the direction of data exchange of the deployment module, which of the following methods</p><p id="doxmyBmoPuVOqJN2OMoag0gPDch">确认部署模块的数据的互通方向，是以下哪种方式</p><ol><li id="doxmyyl9yD8Kvskuqt1N5EgP6Uc" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">ROW one-way interoperability to EU/US. Applicable to ROW writing, EU/US only displays, such as existing resource modules.</li></ol><p id="doxmynZLP2fQUjFKe57ELCzT4ub">      ROW单向互通至EU/US。    适用于ROW写，EU/US仅展示 ，比如现有的资源模块。</p><ol><li id="doxmysxEyMztBHwnvnhU09r1Dzh" seq-marker="1. ">EU/US one-way interoperability to ROW. Applicable to EU/US writing, ROW display only.</li></ol><p id="doxmyVYQOKww12TeOpx90pcDm3f">      EU/US单向互通至ROW。    适用于EU/US写，ROW仅展示。</p><ol><li id="doxmyGPhpwUedzsbCel28kchAQc" seq-marker="1. ">Not interoperable, data is only retained in EU/US. For example, the existing top gifter module.</li></ol><p id="doxmyNh60IVZHff7f1ENwuGzMyb">      不互通，数据仅保留在在EU/US。  比如现有的金主模块。</p><ol><li id="doxmy2U9ZsU5iyrJ7fajEmUGGuh" seq-marker="1. ">Two-way interoperability. Data is interoperable between ROW and EU/US. </li></ol><p id="doxmy9PDJHC7wcYxfa5g9f2G8mg">       双向互通。    数据在ROW和EU/US间双向互通。 </p></p><p id="doxmySGAan2jjwCE66eN5CMzTMh"></p><p id="doxmyJGhq6E1i7wkxPMgHPlIhLf"></p><p id="doxmyRWduDxW2YzdAMZLZc7TKnc"></p><h3 id="doxmydfCQtATedkOQ6ZQOykSoe4">Data table </h3><p id="doxmynMUxiwpSmnklO7iBEjXBDf">If this is a data dashboard, insight pages, please provide a data table(excel version) </p><table id="doxmy1O1EtTXTJrDc45dzpG2Ggc"><colgroup><col width="131"/><col width="129"/><col width="208"/><col width="207"/><col width="100"/><col width="137"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p id="doxmymvs0kxABK8QQgxaEVCQykf"><b>Dashboard Order</b></p></td><td><p id="doxmyJv44O0nho138w4arDT73rh"><b>Metric </b></p></td><td><p id="doxmyls3EMC0dEvKcOsUnd2K0Ah"><b>Description</b></p></td><td><p id="doxmy1NADdg145u5zyAwaR74lHD"><b>Format</b></p></td><td><p id="doxmyd6rOcgqa4mgraeUIwNBYad"><b>Sample</b></p></td><td><p id="doxmyiKahfMV43ZzCM4w4IVhfvg"><b>Data source(optional)</b></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2"><p id="doxmySkcpciUCDcxjAc6IBtbIK9">1 </p></td><td><p id="doxmydba5szZaUmPLuCGHhvxarg">Country code </p></td><td><p id="doxmy0xoEaNr67yQXhfAv7265Nb">The user's country </p></td><td><p id="doxmyYhGi0nb7qkJEwrlpXb1PHd"></p></td><td><p id="doxmy5EG1aGtBfbAJZMjD42kv0b">US+ </p></td><td><p id="doxmye81ia1XGWgHhNGhUDxoHnc">RPC </p></td></tr><tr><td><p id="doxmyQ4fSIHe5c19WWeQbS50Uf9">Publish Rate </p></td><td><p id="doxmyJsGBDxG8RE2Ffmgj1bouQG">By country publish rate </p></td><td><p id="doxmy4EEZ7xzS9vFAJBBWG5okSf">Publish count UVV/DAU UVV </p></td><td><p id="doxmyOHAmZj3t0yFDSSlwjcsL4b">18.99% </p></td><td><p id="doxmydtWKiLyDRjQ8O13b2LAFWh">Hive table </p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="doxmyc9BOG3TmqvUM0x9veL8Lwd"><b>Compliance and security strategy//合规和安全策略</b></h3><sheet id="doxmygTorjI5wvsx9s7V8NOW5th" sheet-id="ikp9EZ" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHnyte"></sheet><p id="doxmyn5HDmPCRitWkM4TMDcvL1b"></p><h1 id="doxmy6rYYfTgNRrGjDf7ZTKea8c">Dependencies // 依赖</h1><sheet id="doxmyegz4ILmepalmHQWMupC7Mc" sheet-id="5dIW3b" token="FQAsst3twh1vjLtuKdnmKjHny